<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{{ app_name }} — {{ env }}</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-1: #0b1020;
      --bg-2: #11182d;
      --bg-3: #0f172a;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --muted: #cbd5e1;
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --glass-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      --accent-1: #38bdf8;
      --accent-2: #8b5cf6;
      --accent-3: #34d399;
      --accent-4: #f59e0b;
      --success: #22c55e;
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --shadow: 0 20px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      --radius-xl: 28px;
      --radius-lg: 20px;
      --radius-md: 16px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.24), transparent 26%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.22), transparent 24%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.18), transparent 24%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-1) 0%, var(--bg-2) 45%, var(--bg-3) 100%);
      padding: 36px 18px 60px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .orb {
      position: fixed;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(80px);
      opacity: 0.35;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: float 10s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .orb-1 {
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
      background: var(--accent-1);
      top: 60px;
      left: -40px;
    }

    .orb-2 {
      width: 280px;
      height: 280px;
      background: var(--accent-2);
      top: 45%;
      right: -60px;
      animation-delay: 2s;
    }

    .orb-3 {
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      background: var(--accent-3);
      bottom: 20px;
      left: 18%;
      animation-delay: 4s;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) translateX(0px); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-16px) translateX(10px); }
    }

    .container {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.10), rgba(255,255,255,0.05));
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      padding: 56px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -2px;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--accent-1), var(--accent-2), var(--accent-3), var(--accent-4), var(--accent-1));
      background-size: 300% 300%;
      animation: glow 12s ease infinite;
      filter: blur(42px);
      opacity: 0.28;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    @keyframes glow {
      0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
      50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
      100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    }

    .topbar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--success);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.9);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.8rem);
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-1), #c084fc, var(--accent-3));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.16rem;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 820px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      opacity: 0.96;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #06b6d4, #8b5cf6);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      color: var(--text);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 22px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
      background: var(--glass-strong);
    }

    .label {
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .value {
      font-size: 1.28rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text);
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    .section-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.95fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }

    .panel h2 {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      min-width: 520px;
    }

    thead th {
      text-align: left;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.28), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.22));
      color: #eef6ff;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    tbody td {
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    tbody td:first-child {
      color: #e2e8f0;
      width: 42%;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .list-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
    }

    .list-item strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .list-item span {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    .mono {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 0.95em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .stats,
      .section-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 34px 24px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      body {
        padding: 18px 12px 40px;
      }

      h1 {
        line-height: 1.02;
      }

      .panel {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .topbar,
      .cta-row {
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-3"></div>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="topbar">
        <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span> Infrastructure active</span>
        <span class="pill">Environnement : <strong>{{ env }}</strong></span>
        <span class="pill">Version : <strong>{{ app_version }}</strong></span>
      </div>

      <h1>
        Bienvenue sur
        <span class="gradient-text">{{ app_name }}</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="lead">
        Plateforme web provisionnée avec <strong>Terraform</strong>, configurée avec
        <strong>Ansible</strong> et sécurisée avec <strong>Ansible Vault</strong>.
        Cette interface confirme que toute la chaîne d’automatisation fonctionne correctement.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">NovaSphere Online</a>
        <a href="#details" class="btn btn-secondary">Voir les détails techniques</a>
      </div>

      <div class="stats">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="label">Serveur</div>
          <div class="value">{{ inventory_hostname }}</div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="label">Adresse IP</div>
          <div class="value">{{ ansible_host }}</div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="label">Stack</div>
          <div class="value">Terraform + Ansible</div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="label">Web Server</div>
          <div class="value">Nginx</div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-grid" id="details">
      <article class="panel">
        <h2>Informations de déploiement</h2>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Information</th>
                <th>Valeur</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Nom de l’application</td>
                <td>{{ app_name }}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Environnement</td>
                <td>{{ env }}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Version</td>
                <td>{{ app_version }}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Hôte Ansible</td>
                <td>{{ inventory_hostname }}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>IP publique</td>
                <td>{{ ansible_host }}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Paquets installés</td>
                <td>{{ packages | join(', ') }}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>API Key (masquée)</td>
                <td class="mono">{{ api_key[:8] }}********</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Base de données</td>
                <td>Configurée ({{ db_password | length }} caractères)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </article>

      <aside class="panel">
        <h2>État de la plateforme</h2>
        <div class="list">
          <div class="list-item">
            <div class="icon">⚙️</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Provisioning automatisé</strong>
              <span>L’infrastructure a été créée via Terraform avec génération automatique de l’inventaire.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="list-item">
            <div class="icon">🔐</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Secrets sécurisés</strong>
              <span>Les données sensibles sont gérées avec Ansible Vault et injectées dans le template sans exposition complète.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="list-item">
            <div class="icon">🚀</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Déploiement idempotent</strong>
              <span>Le playbook peut être rejoué sans casser l’existant ni reconfigurer inutilement la machine.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="list-item">
            <div class="icon">🧩</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Architecture modulaire</strong>
              <span>Le serveur web est organisé en rôle Ansible avec tâches, handlers, variables et templates dédiés.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
